<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TD-48> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Dark enchantment. A non-Wizard character facing a strike from a Dragon hazard creature attack loses all skills while bearing this card. The strike’s prowess is modified by -3. Cannot be duplicated on a given character. If at a Haven/Darkhaven [{H}] during his organization phase, a character with this card may tap to attempt to remove it. Make a roll—if this result is greater than 8, discard this card. Modify the roll by +1 for each character in his company that taps in support."@en .
