<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/DM-76> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "As a permanent-event, playable on a face-down agent who was brought into play this turn. When the agent is revealed, and if his home site is a Border-hold [{B}] or a Free-hold [{F}], the site where he came into play (which is not represented by a card) may legally be any Border-hold [{B}] or a Free-hold [{F}]. Discard when the agent is revealed.Alternatively, as a short-event, take any agent who has a home site that is a Free-hold [{F}] or Border-hold [{B}] from your play deck into your hand (reveal it to your opponent and reshuffle your play deck).Cannot be played if your opponent is a minion player."@en .
