<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TW-206> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:quote> "“For each of the hobbits he chose a dagger, long, leaf-shaped, and keen, of marvelous workmanship, damasked with serpent-forms in red and gold. They gleamed as he drew them from their black sheaths, wrought of some strange metal, light and strong, and set with many fiery stones.” —LotRI"@en .
