<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TW-268> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:quote> "“… the Lossoth, the Snowmen of Forochel… were uneasy; for they said that they smelled danger in the wind.” —LotR"@en .
