<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/LE-233> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Magic. Spirit-magic. Playable on a spirit-magic-using character during the organization phase. Opponent may reveal to you any hazards from his hand, and only those hazards can be played during the character company’s movement/hazard phase. Unless he is a Ringwraith, character  makes a corruption check modified  by -3."@en .
