<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TW-140> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Denethor II"@fr .
<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TD-123> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Tap a character during his site phase at a tapped or untapped Ruins & Lairs [{R}]. Make a roll modified by +3 if character is a diplomat. An ally may be played and placed under the character’s control if the result is greater than 6 plus the ally’s mind stat and the ally is not restricted from moving in this site’s region. If an ally is played, tap the site if it is not already tapped."@en .
<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/WH-103> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "École des arcanes"@fr .
<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/DM-43> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:alignment> "Neutral" .
<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TD-129> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Peut être jouée sur un Elfe à un Havre [{H}]. Engagez l’Elfe. Quand il affronte une attaque, le porteur peut s’engager pour donner +1 à la prouesse de tous les personnages de sa compagnie contre cette attaque. Le porteur fait un test de corruption."@fr .
