<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/BA-23> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Playable on a company at or moving to a Ruins & Lairs [{R}] or Under-deeps site if you discard an Animal or Spider creature from your hand. Tap all untapped characters in the company with a mind less than 2 plus the number of Spawn cards in play. Eliminated Spawn do not count. Does not affect Wizards or Ringwraiths."@en .
