<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TD-33> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Playable on a company facing an Undead attack. The prowess of the attack is modified by +1.Corruption. The next character wounded by the attack (on whom a corruption card has not already been played this turn) receives 2 corruption points (place this card with the character). Discard Icy Touch if it is not played with a character.During his organization phase, a character with this card may tap and attempt to remove it. Make a roll: if this result is greater than a 6, discard this card."@en .
