<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TD-62> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Unique. Unless Scatha Ahunt is in play, Gondmaeglom has an additional automatic-attack: Dragon — 3 strikes at 16/9.In addition, -1 to all influence attempts."@en .
