<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/LE-159> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Magic. Shadow-magic. Playable during the site phase on a non-Ringwraith, non-Wizard character at the same site as a shadow-magic-using character you control. Target character must make a corruption check modified by -1 followed by a body check (modified by +1 if tapped). If target character is a hero and is eliminated by these checks, you receive his kill marshalling points. Unless the shadow-magic-user is a Ringwraith, he makes a corruption check modified by -5.May target an opponent’s character."@en .
