<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TW-228> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:quote> "“Learn now the lore of Living Creatures! … Ent the earthborn, old as mountains…” —LotRIII"@en .
<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/BA-5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bûthrakaur"@nl .
<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/WH-94> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Oromë’s Warders"@en .
