<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/AS-108> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Magic. Shadow-magic. Playable on a wounded character in a company with a shadow-magic-using character. Wounded character becomes untapped with -1 to body. Discard at the end of his untap phase if at a Darkhaven [{DH}]. Unless the shadow-magic-user is a Ringwraith, hemakes a corruption check modified by -3."@en .
<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/AS-139> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:rarity> "U2" .
<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TW-208> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Class:Resource> .
