<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TD-111> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Playable only at the end of the organization phase. Tap an Elf. If his company’s site path only has one or two regions with no Dark-domains [{d}] and no Shadow-lands [{s}], opponent may only play hazard creatures this turn that are keyed to the company’s new site."@en .
