<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/LE-192> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Scout only. Playable during the organization phase on a scout whose company is not moving. All hazard creature attacks against the scout’s company this turn are canceled."@en .
