<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TW-368> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:quote> "“Most of the Men of the northern regions… were descended from the Edain of the First Age, or from their close kin… Of this kind were the peoples of the upper vales of Anduin: the Beornings, and the Woodmen of Western Mirkwood…” —LotR"@en .
