<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/DM-146> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Playable on a company with a sage during the site phase at a site where gold ring items are playable. Tap this card if the company plays a ring special item; this card never untaps. If this card is tapped, the company can discard (for no effect) a Lost Knowledge card it controls during its site phase at Mount Doom and invert this card on the playing surface (rotate it 180°). If inverted, you can store this card at a Haven [{H}]—only if stored do you receive its marshalling points. If stored, all ring items give one less corruption point. Once inverted, no other copy of this card can be inverted."@en .
