<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/LE-58> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Unique. Manifestation of The Witch-king of Angmar. Can use spirit-magic and shadow-magic. +3 direct influence in Heralded Lord mode. +1 prowess in Fell Rider mode. As your Ringwraith, up to two Ringwraith followers in his company may be controlled with no influence. You may bring these followers into play during separate organization phases."@en .
<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/LE-419> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Dardo Mortífero"@es .
<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TD-179> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:quote> "“… tucked in a ring of volcanic rock within a high vale and surrounded by a natural, flower-filled moat.” —Kuduk Lore"@en .
