<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/AS-116> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Unique. Manifestation of Eärcaraxë. Playable at Isle of the Ulond if the influence check is greater than 11. Modifications: influencer discards a major item (+2) or a greater item (+5).All attacks by manifestations of Eärcaraxë against any of your companies are canceled. Any company moving in Andrast Coast, Bay of Belfalas, Eriadoran Coast, and/or Andrast faces one attack: Dragon — 2 strikes at 17/7 (attacker chooses defending characters)."@en .
