<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/DM-29> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Unique. Manifestation of Gollum. Agent. If face-up, may take an extra agent action (not counting against the hazard limit) each time he normally takes an agent action. If he attacks successfully against a company with a ring, he and a ring (attacker's choice) are discarded. If My Precious attacks and fails but is not defeated, the defender may tap a character in the target company to play Gollum (My Precious is discarded). Any player whose character eliminates My Precious receives -1 kill MPs."@en .
