<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/LE-57> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Unique. Manifestation of Ûvatha the Horseman. Can use spirit-magic. -3 direct influence in Heralded Lord mode. -1 prowess in Fell Rider mode. He may join another Ringwraith’s company during your organization phase and requires no influence to control. As your Ringwraith, if at a Darkhaven [{DH}], he may tap during your organization phase to move one resource event card from your discard pile to your play deck and reshuffle."@en .
