<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/BA-90> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Adjacent Sites: Glittering Caves (0), The Pûkel-deeps (8), The Under-gates (6)Playable: Items (minor, major, gold ring)Automatic-attacks (2):(1st) Undead — 3 strikes with 9 prowess(2nd) Opponent may play as an automatic-attack one non-unique hazard creature from his hand normally keyed to a Shadow-hold [{S}]Special: Any Undead creature or Pûkel-creature may be keyed to this site."@en .
