<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/AS-1> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Unique. Manifestation of “Bert”. May not be included with a starting company. May be played on the same turn Tûma and/or Wûluag is played, without counting against the one character per turn limit. Discard on a body check result of 8. +1 prowess against Dwarves. Tap Bûrat to untap Tûma or Wûluag if at the same site. If Tûma and/or Wûluag is in his company, Bûrat’s mind is reduced by one."@en .
