<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/AS-165> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Adjacent Sites: Moria (0), The Under-grottos (7), The Gem-deeps (6), The Sulfur-deeps (4), Under-leas (5)Playable: Items (minor, major)Automatic-attacks (2):(1st) Balrog — 2 strikes with 16 prowess(2nd) Opponent may play as an automatic-attack one non-unique hazard creature from his hand normally keyed to a Ruins & Lairs [{R}]Special: Non-Nazgûl creatures played at this site attack normally, not as detainment. If a manifestation of Balrog of Moria is in play or defeated, the first automatic-attack is canceled."@en .
