<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/BA-40> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Playable on a unique non-Dragon faction. Place a Border-hold [{B}] from your location deck “off to the side” with this card. The Border-hold must be in the same region or adjacent thereto as a site where the target faction is playable. Return any faction playable at the Border-hold to its owner’s hand. -5 to any attempt to play a faction at any version of the Border-hold. All versions of the Border-hold gain an additional automatic-attack: same type as your target faction — 5 strikes with 9 prowess (detainment against your companies). Cannot be duplicated on your faction."@en .
