<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/LE-117> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Environment. Each moving company that has at least two Wildernesses [{w}] in its site path must return to its site of origin unless it contains a ranger. Additionally, if Doors of Night is in play, each non-Haven/non-Darkhaven site in play with at least two Wildernesses [{w}] in its site path is tapped. Cannot be duplicated."@en .
