<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/LE-46> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:quote> "“Exiled with his family at the age of fifteen, he returned a year later and assassinated the High Chieftain Pos Ari. This slaying spawned a reign of sorrow and bloodshed.” —Kuduk Lore"@en .
