<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/LE-169> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Sage only. Playable on an untapped sage during the site phase at a Ruins & Lairs [{R}] in a Wilderness [{w}]. Opponent must reveal to you a non-Ringwraith, non-Wizard character from his hand if available; otherwise, he must reveal his entire hand. If a character is so revealed, make a roll. If the sage is a Ringwraith, modify the roll by -2. According to the result, you may play an item from your hand with the sage (tapping the sage): The One Ring (10,11,12), a Dwarven Ring (8,9,10,11,12), or a Spirit Ring (0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7)."@en .
