<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/LE-189> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Magic. Shadow-magic. Playable on a shadow-magic-using character facing an attack before strikes are assigned. An ally with a prowess of 5 is created which leaves the game when the attack is finished. In all cases, the ally must face one of the attack’s strikes. Unless he is a Ringwraith, character  makes a corruption check modified  by -4."@en .
