<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/LE-416> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:quote> "“… they found themselves in a rock-chamber, wide and rough, with an uneven stooping roof.” —LotRIV"@en .
<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/WH-10> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Medio-orco. Descartar con un chequeo de resistencia de 9."@es .
