<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/WH-46> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Playable on a company. One agent character may be played with target company at a Darkhaven [{DH}] or in your starting company — place this card with the agent. -1 to his mind to a minimum of 1. This card may be played with a starting company in lieu of a minor item. When played as such, reveal it when starting companies are determined as if it were a character.Does not allow you to start with a character that says he cannot be in the starting company. Cannot be duplicated on a given character. Cannot be included in a Balrog's deck."@en .
