<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TW-314> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Sage only during the site phase at an untapped site where Information is playable. Tap the sage and the site. Sage may not untap until Reforging is stored at a Haven [{H}].During your organization phase, you may tap a sage at a Haven and discard a stored Reforging to retrieve any minor or major weapon, armor, or shield (even a hoard item) from your discard pile. The item must be placed under the control of a character in the sage’s company."@en .
