<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/LE-157> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Playable at any tapped or untapped Ruins & Lairs [{R}] with a Wolf automatic-attack or at any tapped or untapped Shadow-hold [{S}] with an Orc automatic-attack."@en .
<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/LE-236> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Playable on a company at a tapped Ruins & Lairs [{R}], Border-hold [{B}], or Free-hold [{F}]. During the site phase, one or two characters in that company may each tap to take control of a non-unique, non-hoard minor item of the following type: weapon, armor, shield, or helmet. You may take these items from your play deck (reshuffle if used), discard pile, and/or sideboard."@en .
<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/Mentha_Brandybuck> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/Property:hairColor> "Dark Brown" .
