<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TW-4> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Unique.Nazgûl (5th). May be played as a hazard creature (with one strike) or as a permanent-event.As a creature, may also be played keyed to Harondor, Horse Plains, Gorgoroth, and Khand; and may also be played at sites in these regions.If played as a permanent-event, it will remain in play until tapped during the opponent’s movement/hazard phase (tapping counts against the hazard limit). When tapped, Akhôrahil becomes a short-event and modifies any one character’s body by -1 for the rest of this turn."@en .
