<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/LE-103> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "The number of strikes for each automatic-attack at a Free-hold [{F}] or Border-hold [{B}] is doubled. Additionally, each detainment automatic-attack at a Free-hold [{F}] or Border-hold [{B}] becomes a normal automatic-attack. Cannot be duplicated."@en .
