<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/LE-303> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "May only be played at a Free-hold [{F}] where gold rings are playable. Bearer must make a corruption check at the end of each of his untap phases. Discard Bright Gold Ring when tested. If tested, make a roll to determine which ring card may be immediately played: a Spirit Ring (8,9,10,11,12+); a Dwarven Ring (9,10,11,12+); a Magic Ring (1,2,3,4,5); a Lesser Ring (any result). You may search your play deck or discard pile for a Lesser Ring to be played."@en .
<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TW-421> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Class:Site> .
