<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/LE-310> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:quote> "“… y le arrancó el vendaje de la cabeza. Luego le untó la herida con una sustancia oscura que sacó de una cajita de madera.” —SdlA III"@es .
<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/DM-83> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "All Orc and Troll automatic-attacks receive +3 strikes and +2 prowess. Discard this card when such an automatic-attack is defeated. Cannot be duplicated."@en .
