<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/LE-128> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Playable on a minion company at or moving to a Free-hold [{F}] or Border-hold [{B}], or playable on a hero company at or moving to a Shadow-hold [{S}] or Dark-hold [{D}]. The prowess and body of each character in the company is modified by -1. Discard this card during its organization phase if the company is at a Haven/Darkhaven [{H}]. Cannot be duplicated on a given company."@en .
