<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/AS-93> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Ranger only. Playable during the organization phase on a ranger. If his company uses region movement, it may move as if the following pairs of regions were adjacent: Ithilien and Gorgoroth, Ithilien and Nurn, Harondor and Nurn. The company faces a detainment attack at the beginning of its movement/hazard phase: Orcs — 4 strikes with 6 prowess.Alternatively, if the site moved to is in one of the regions listed above, the hazard limit is reduced by two (to a minimum of two)."@en .
