<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/DM-52> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "For each company at or moving to an Under-deeps site, the hazard limit is increased by one and the prowess of all attacks is increased by one. All automatic-attacks at sites in the following regions have their number of strikes and prowess increased by one (by two if Doors of Night is in play): Angmar, Gap of Isen, Gorgoroth, Gundabad, High Pass, Redhorn Gate, Rohan, Southern Mirkwood, and Udûn. Cannot be duplicated."@en .
