<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/BA-71> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Balrog specific. If Great Shadow is not in play, The Balrog may move with region movement (overriding his card) to an Under-deeps surface site or from an Under-deeps surface site. Based on his marshalling point (MP) total, he may use the following number of regions: 0-8 MPs – 1 region; 9-16 MPs – 2 regions; 17-24 MPs – 3 regions; 25+ MPs – 4 regions. This region allowance may  not be modified by any other effects except A More Evil Hour."@en .
