<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TD-103> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Burglary attempt. Tap a character to make a burglary attempt at a site in lieu of facing its automatic-attacks. Tap the site and make a roll modified by +2 if the character is a scout and by +3 if he is a Hobbit. If the result is greater than 10, an item normally playable at the site may be played with the character. If the attempt fails, the character must face all automatic-attacks alone."@en .
