<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/DM-99> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Playable on a Hobbit facing a strike from an Orc attack. Target Hobbit receives +2 prowess against the strike. If strike is successful, he is not harmed and is taken prisoner at a Dark-hold [{D}], Shadow-hold [{S}], or Ruins & Lairs [{R}]. If the Hobbit bears a ring, his player makes a roll at the start of each of his untap phases—if the result is less that 7, discard the ring.Rescue-attacks (3): Orcs — 3 strikes with 6 prowess, Orcs — 4 strikes with 7 prowess, Orcs — 5 strikes with 8 prowess."@en .
