<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/AS-12> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Unique. Dúnedain. Four strikes. Detainment against hero companies. Playable at Anfalas, Belfalas, Lamedon, Lebennin, or Anórien; or at sites in these regions. Unless the attack is canceled, all untapped characters in defending company are tapped following this attack."@en .
