<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TD-6> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Corruption. Place with any wounded character in a company that just faced a Nazgûl attack; the character receives 3 corruption points. Target character makes a body check during each of his organization phases.Whenever target character would normally heal, instead make a roll: if this result is greater than 10, he heals normally and this card is removed. This roll is modified by +2 if the character is at a Haven/Darkhaven [{H}] and by +2 for each sage in his company that taps in support."@en .
