<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/WH-67> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Technology. Playable during the site phase if one of your companies enters the Deep Mines site and you have more Delver’s Harvest cards in play than you have Earth-eater cards. Tap Earth-eater to take a minion non-unique weapon/armor/shield/helmet major item from your sideboard or discard pile to your hand."@en .
