<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TW-27> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Corruption. Playable on a non-Hobbit, non-Wizard, non-Ringwraith character. Target character receives 2 corruption points and makes a corruption check each time a character in his company becomes wounded. During his organization phase, the character may tap to attempt to remove this card. Make a roll—if the result is greater than 4, discard this card. Cannot be duplicated on a given character."@en .
