<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TW-269> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Scout only. During the site phase, tap a scout at a tappedor untapped Shadow-hold [{S}] or Dark-hold [{D}]. Turn over cards from your play deck one at a time until: you reveal a non-special item (it cannot be a unique item already in play) or reach the end (does not exhaust the play deck). If you reveal such an item, the scout takes control of it. In any case, the scout faces a single strike attack with prowess equal to 3 plus the number of cards revealed. This attack/strike cannot be canceled. Discard the item if the scout is wounded. Reshuffle all revealed cards except the item back into the play deck."@en .
