<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/LE-235> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "You may play this card as a resource or a hazard according to The Audience of Sauron Rules. This card may not be played as a hazard against a Wizard player, and may be included as a hazard in a Wizard’s deck. You may reshuffle this card into you play deck at any time that it is in your hand (show opponent)."@en .
