<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/LE-116> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Playable on a Ruins & Lairs [{R}]. An additional automatic-attack is created at the site until the end of the turn. This is an exact duplicate (including all existing and eventual modifications to prowess, etc.) of an existing automatic-attack at the site of your choice. This automatic-attack is faced immediately following its original. Cannot be duplicated on a given site."@en .
