<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TW-317> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Unique. Playable at Edoras if the influence check is greater than 9. Standard Modifications: Hobbits (+1), Dúnedain (+1)."@en .
