<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TD-16> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Corruption. Dark enchantment. Playable on a non-Wizard character facing a strike from a Dragon hazard creature attack. The strike’s prowess is modified by -1. The character receives 2 corruption points. The target character makes a corruption check at the end of his untap phase. Cannot be duplicated on a given character.During his organization phase, a sage in the target character’s company may tap to attempt to remove this card. Make a roll: if this result is greater than 6, discard this card."@en .
