<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/LE-284> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Unique. Manifestation of Scorba. Playable at Zarak Dûm if the influence check is greater than 11. Modifications: influencer discards a major item (+3) or a greater item (+6). All attacks by manifestations of Scorba against any of your companies are canceled. Any company moving in Angmar, Gundabad, and/or Forochel faces one attack: Dragon — 3 strikes at 12/8 (attacker chooses defending characters)."@en .
