<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/AS-39> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "This card reserves up to one Dragon or Drake hazard creature at a time. To reserve a Dragon or Drake creature, place it face up “off to the side” with this card (not counting against the hazard limit). You may play a reserved creature as though it were in your hand. Discard this card after the reserved creature attacks. A reserved Dragon or Drake receives +2 prowess when attacking."@en .
