<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/WH-15> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Playable on a Fallen-wizard. Make a roll and add the Fallen-wizard’s stage points. If the result is less than 16, discard this card. Otherwise, place this card with the Fallen-wizard. The Fallen-wizard’s player must use minion sites for Border-holds [{B}], Free-holds [{F}], and hero Havens [{H}]. Also, the Fallen-wizard’s company is overt."@en .
