<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/BA-11> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Animals. Each wounded character faces one strike. All body checks resulting from successful strikes are modified by an additional +1. Each untapped character in the company may tap to cancel a strike against a wounded character."@en .
