<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/AS-75> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Unique. Playable at Goblin-gate. Orc. Manifestation of The Great Goblin.Its controlling character's company is overt. Tap to give +2 prowess to all Orcs in its company: against one attack or in company versus company combat."@en .
