<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/LE-254> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Playable on an untapped Orc or Troll character bearing a Whip. Each tapped character in the bearer’s company with a mind and prowess less than the bearer’s makes a body check modified by -2. Failing the body check wounds, but does not eliminate the character. An Orc or Troll is discarded according to its card. Each unwounded character in the company becomes untapped."@en .
