<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/AS-7> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Unique. Maia. Manifestation of Alatar. Two strikes. Attacker chooses defending characters. Detainment and -3 prowess against hero companies. Discard this card if Alatar comes into play. As a creature, may also be played keyed to Andrast, Old Pûkel Gap, Anfalas, Lamedon, Lebennin, Belfalas, or Anórien; or at sites in these regions. As a permanent-event, all Maia attacks: receive +1 prowess and +1 strike and attacker chooses defending characters. Discard when any play deck is exhausted."@en .
