<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TW-139> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:quote> "“… and they were Rangers of Ithilien; for they were descended from folk who lived in Ithilien at one time, before it was overrun.” —LotRIV"@en .
<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/AS-21> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:quote> "“‘But still we fight on, holding all the west shores of Anduin; and those who shelter behind us give us praise…’” —LotRII"@en .
