<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TW-301> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Unique. Palantír. If the bearer’s company is ever below 4 characters and the company moves, discard. 5 marshalling pts. if stored in a Haven [{H}]. With its bearer able to use a Palantír, tap Palantír of Osgiliath to force the discard of any hazard permanent-event or to duplicate the effect of any Palantír in play. Bearer makes a corruption check."@en .
