<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TD-110> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Play on a resource long-event if Doors of Night is not in play. The long-event is not discarded as normal during a long-event phase. Discard Echo of All Joy and target long-event when any play deck is exhausted or when Doors of Night comes into play."@en .
