<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/LE-240> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Playable during the site phase on an untapped character at a site where Information is playable. Tap the character (but not the site). No marshalling points are received until this card is stored at a Darkhaven [{DH}] during the character’s organization phase."@en .
