<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TW-46> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Unique.Nazgûl (4th). May be played as a hazard creature (with one strike) or as a permanent-event.As a creature, may also be played keyed to Harondor, Imlad Morgul, Gorgoroth, and Khand; and may also be played at sites in these regions.If played as a permanent-event, it will remain in play until tapped during the opponent’s movement/hazard phase (tapping counts against the hazard limit). When tapped, Indûr Dawndeath becomes a short-event and makes any wounded character discard an item of his choice (but not a ring)."@en .
