<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/TD-70> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Unique. Any company moving in Withered Heath, Northern Rhovanion, Iron Hills, and/or Grey Mountain Narrows faces one Dragon attack (considered a hazard creature attack) — 3 strikes at 15/7 (attacker chooses defending characters).If Doors of Night is in play, this attack also affects: Brown Lands, Southern Rhovanion, Dorwinion, Dagorlad, and Horse Plains."@en .
