<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/LE-315> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Bearer must make a corruption check at the end of each of his untap phases. Discard this ring when tested. If tested, obtain a random value to determine which ring card may be immediately played: The One Ring (12+); a Dwarven Ring (10,11,12+); a Magic Ring (1,2,3,4,5,6,7); a Lesser Ring (any result)."@en .
