<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/DM-147> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Stolen Knowledge. Playable on an untapped character at a Shadow-hold [{S}] or Dark-hold [{D}] or if his company faced an agent attack and all of its strikes failed. Tap character. Can be stored at a Haven [{H}]—only if stored do you receive its marshalling point. If stored, you may discard this card and force one non-unique hazard to be removed from the game as you see your opponent discard it through a mechanism of the game."@en .
