<https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/DM-164> <https://tolkiengateway.net/wiki/MECCG/Property:cardText> "Playable at an untapped Isengard, Shadow-hold [{S}], or Dark-hold [{D}] during the site phase.Tap the site. The company faces an Orc attack (4 strikes with 9 prowess). Afterwards, a character may tap and place this card under him. If you do not place this card with a character after the attack, discard it. That character may not untap until after this card is stored in a Haven [{H}] during the organization phase. When this card is stored, and if your Wizard is not already in play, you may search your play deck or discard pile for a Wizard and play him at that Haven [{H}] (does not count towards the one character per turn limit). Cannot be duplicated by a given player. Cannot be included in a Fallen-wizard's deck."@en .
